# 默认按文本处理，但下面这些必须钉死行尾，否则 Windows 上会坏
* text=auto

# .bat 必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 这些二进制别让 git 做任何转换
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.npy binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
